(5946718, 866645, 115307, '<td valign="top">While its not the best photographed in the bunch, it certainly made me laugh. Well done. 7</td>', 'While its not the best photographed in the bunch, it certainly made me laugh. Well done. 7', '2010-04-14 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
