(5946746, 867408, 67258, '<td valign="top">The pose doesn''t really work for me, and isn''t particularly flattering to your model.  The lighting seems failrly basic, and the shadow across the arm is distracting.</td>', 'The pose doesn''t really work for me, and isn''t particularly flattering to your model.  The lighting seems failrly basic, and the shadow across the arm is distracting.', '2010-04-14 16:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
