(5950020, 867404, 39830, '<td valign="top">My lowest rated image for this challenge. Without changing composition, here are a few things you could have done differently to have gotten a better score from me.<br/> <br/>Focus - The only place that appears to be in focus is a small spot on the wall. Even if heavy bokeh is what you are going for, your subject (the lingerie) should be in sharp focus. It should stand out so that there is no doubt it is the subject of your photo.<br/> <br/>Color - It''s a bit flat. A quick adjustment to the contrast and the image would have a lot more pop to it.<br/> <br/>Shutter speed - I suspect this was your number one problem. It is way too slow. A faster speed and the image would be less washed out and the details would be sharper.<br/> <br/>Your composition is good. With a few tweaks to camera and a few nudges in post it has a lot of potential. Hope this feedback was helpful.</td>', 'My lowest rated image for this challenge. Without changing composition, here are a few things you could have done differently to have gotten a better score from me. Focus - The only place that appears to be in focus is a small spot on the wall. Even if heavy bokeh is what you are going for, your subject (the lingerie) should be in sharp focus. It should stand out so that there is no doubt it is the subject of your photo. Color - It''s a bit flat. A quick adjustment to the contrast and the image would have a lot more pop to it. Shutter speed - I suspect this was your number one problem. It is way too slow. A faster speed and the image would be less washed out and the details would be sharper. Your composition is good. With a few tweaks to camera and a few nudges in post it has a lot of potential. Hope this feedback was helpful.', '2010-04-16 22:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
