(5959910, 867544, 70128, '<td valign="top">It''s sad how some people freely insult peers/models just because of their shape. Buddy, don''t let those pig headed narrow minded puritans make you feel bad. You are right where you say that it would have scored higher had it been a young slim girl. That''s how SAD and IGNORANT society is. You got my thumbs up!</td>', 'It''s sad how some people freely insult peers/models just because of their shape. Buddy, don''t let those pig headed narrow minded puritans make you feel bad. You are right where you say that it would have scored higher had it been a young slim girl. That''s how SAD and IGNORANT society is. You got my thumbs up!', '2010-04-21 03:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
