(5960347, 867398, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congratulations...be it that it''s not related to photography but rather providing me with laughter going through the peopel''s comments and reaction to your picture. If DPC was a house with a front door and a back door, you just broke a hole in the wall on the side and gave a whole new meaning to "door". I cant get to like your pic sorry, but Oh the reactions... Sorry to hear that you are starting over with your building to an above 5 score...:( Looking at that 219 1''s its a scary thought.</td>', 'Congratulations...be it that it''s not related to photography but rather providing me with laughter going through the peopel''s comments and reaction to your picture. If DPC was a house with a front door and a back door, you just broke a hole in the wall on the side and gave a whole new meaning to "door". I cant get to like your pic sorry, but Oh the reactions... Sorry to hear that you are starting over with your building to an above 5 score...:( Looking at that 219 1''s its a scary thought.', '2010-04-21 06:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5960352, 867240, 115098, '<td valign="top">thought you would of got a ribbon on this one, the grainy effect is not to everyones taste but is certainly mine! It gives a warmth and personality that none of the others had. Bad luck.</td>', 'thought you would of got a ribbon on this one, the grainy effect is not to everyones taste but is certainly mine! It gives a warmth and personality that none of the others had. Bad luck.', '2010-04-21 06:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
