(5963535, 867398, 70128, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by OmanOtter:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Nope, sorry dude.  You still have no class. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry buddy, you still have no sense of humor. And please stop saying I have no class or telling me to grow up when you don''t even know me, ok? You only saw a humorous (not for many puritans, evidently) photograph I posted, that''s "all" you know about me...<br/> <br/>"Puritanism: The haunting fear that someone, somewhere, may be happy." H.L. Mencken<br/> <br/>Anyway, enough with this. I''m here to amuse myself, not to argue with people. Any comment is welcome, even bad comments, but please refrain from being offensive. Thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by OmanOtter: Nope, sorry dude.  You still have no class.   Sorry buddy, you still have no sense of humor. And please stop saying I have no class or telling me to grow up when you don''t even know me, ok? You only saw a humorous (not for many puritans, evidently) photograph I posted, that''s "all" you know about me... "Puritanism: The haunting fear that someone, somewhere, may be happy." H.L. Mencken Anyway, enough with this. I''m here to amuse myself, not to argue with people. Any comment is welcome, even bad comments, but please refrain from being offensive. Thanks.', '2010-04-22 13:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
